        <mxCell id="pendinglabel" value="&lt;b&gt;PENDING WORK — NOT YET ACCEPTED SHARED KNOWLEDGE&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#18334B;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=20;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
